"┌─[1]─Stat┌ Keybindings ─ Jobs ──────────────────────────────────────┐─────────┐"
"│◐ dev → a│  j/↓  next job                                           │Result   │"
"│3 of 3 jo│  k/↑  previous job                                       │◐ RUNNING│"
"│◐ 1 · ✗ 1│   ^D  ten jobs down                                      │✓ SUCCESS│"
"└─────────│   ^U  ten jobs up                                        │✗ FAILED │"
"┌─[2]─Jobs│    g  first job                                          │         │"
"│ 2h ◐ [so│    G  last job                                           │         │"
"│ 1d ✗ nig│    /  filter by name                                     │         │"
"│    · wee│    m  toggle mine only                                   │         │"
"│         │    f  cycle status: all, failed, active                  │         │"
"│         │Enter  focus the main panel                               │         │"
"│         │    x  actions menu: run, pause schedule, repair, cancel  │         │"
"│         │    r  refresh jobs                                       │         │"
"└─────────│    o  open job in browser                                │         │"
"┌─[3]─Pipe│    y  copy: URL, job ID, name, JSON                      │         │"
"│         │    Y  copy the job list as text                          │─────────┘"
"│         │    s  cycle sort: activity, name, created                │─────────┐"
"│         │  0-4  focus panel by number                              │0    84ms│"
"└─────────│  Tab  next side panel                                    │0   131ms│"
"┌─[4]─Comp│    R  refresh everything                                 │         │"
"│         │    +  cycle screen mode                                  │         │"
"│         │    @  toggle the API log                                 │         │"
"└─────────│    A  enable or disable actions this session             │─────────┘"
" Scroll: j└─────────────────j/k: scroll │ Esc: close─────────────────┘    v0.1.0"
